<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'T3059-READREC'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* T3-059 repro: reads a line-sequential file record by record and
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* writes, per record, its number, its length and its first 60 bytes.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FI1 ASSIGN TO DISC RDIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FO1 ASSIGN TO DISC RDOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FI1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FI1-REC              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FO1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FO1-REC              PIC X(80).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-LEN               PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-CP                PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-CNT               PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03 WS-O-CNT          PIC 9(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03 FILLER            PIC X VALUE SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03 WS-O-LEN          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03 FILLER            PIC X VALUE SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03 WS-O-TXT          PIC X(60).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FI1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LIRE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FI1 AT END GO TO FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO WS-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-CNT TO WS-O-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-LEN TO WS-O-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-O-TXT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-LEN TO WS-CP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-CP > 60
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 60 TO WS-CP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-CP > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE FI1-REC (1:WS-CP) TO WS-O-TXT (1:WS-CP).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FO1-REC FROM WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO LIRE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'RECORDS READ = ' WS-CNT UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FI1 FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
</DATA>
